{"id":"verstand","lemma":"Verstand","pos":"noun","rank":899,"glosses":["intellect"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈʃtant/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/De-Verstand.ogg/De-Verstand.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Verstandes","plural":"Verstande"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich verstand nicht, was er sagte.","en":"I didn't catch what he said.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/717867","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"}]},{"text":"Hast du den Verstand verloren?","en":"Have you lost your mind?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"lost, missing"}]},{"text":"Er muss den Verstand verloren haben.","en":"He must have lost his marbles.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"lost, missing"},{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Ich verstand es falsch.","en":"I misunderstood.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/273940","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"it"},{"g":"false"}]},{"text":"Ich verstand den Grund dafür.","en":"I understood the reason for this.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"ground, land"},{"g":"for that, for it"}]}]}